---
layout: page.njk
title: "Accommodation | NEDC26"
heading: "Your NEDC26 stay starts here"
lede: "Hobart offers a range of accommodation to suit different styles and budgets, all within easy reach of the conference and the waterfront."
permalink: "/accommodation/"
ctaHeading: "Book early to secure your preferred option"
ctaText: "A limited number of rooms are available at the delegate rate."
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap stack-l">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Whether you are planning a quick visit for the conference only or extending your stay to explore more of Tasmania, these hotels provide a comfortable and convenient base. We encourage delegates to book early.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="listing">
      {% for h in accommodation %}
      <div class="listing__row{% if h.note %} listing__row--stacked{% endif %}">
        <div class="stack-s">
          <p class="listing__name">{{ h.name }}</p>
          {% if h.venue %}<p><span class="badge">Conference venue</span></p>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="listing__meta">
          <p class="num">{{ h.phone }}</p>
          {% if h.note %}<p style="margin-top:.4em">{{ h.note }}</p>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="listing__actions">
          {% if h.venue %}
            {% set btnText = "Delegate rate" %}{% set btnHref = event.registerUrl %}{% set btnStyle = "primary" %}{% set btnSize = "sm" %}
            {% include "partials/btn.njk" %}
          {% endif %}
          {% set btnText = "Website" %}{% set btnHref = h.url %}{% set btnStyle = "outline" %}{% set btnSize = "sm" %}
          {% include "partials/btn.njk" %}
          {% set btnSize = false %}
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
